# What a merchant does NOT receive.
#
# This file has to live INSIDE the package directory, not only at the repository
# root: `git archive` reads .gitattributes from within the tree it is archiving,
# so in a monorepo a root-only file governs a whole-repo archive nobody
# publishes while every real per-package zip still ships everything below it.
# Per-package rules are therefore kept here.
#
# The same fact cuts the other way: phpcs.xml.dist, phpstan.neon.dist and
# phpunit.xml.dist exist ONLY at the repository root, which is outside every package
# archive already, so a per-package rule for them would never match anything.
Test/ export-ignore
docs/screenshots/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
